WEBVTT

00:25.600 --> 00:26.560
<b>Here’s the lighttime!</b>

00:26.690 --> 00:28.720
<b>Will you guys click the follow button?</b>

00:28.720 --> 00:29.250
<b>Come on!</b>

00:30.340 --> 00:31.640
<b>Lu Guang, say something!</b>

00:33.290 --> 00:35.210
<b>Follow us, please!</b>

00:42.480 --> 00:45.240
<b>Go! Go! Go!</b>

00:45.490 --> 00:46.720
<b>Looks like she’s pretty cunning</b>

00:47.180 --> 00:48.490
<b>The records in this phone have been deleted</b>

00:48.740 --> 00:50.080
<b>Go ahead</b>

00:51.970 --> 00:53.500
<b>Have you found out who’s 
the owner of that number?</b>

00:54.880 --> 00:55.950
<b>The owner’s name is Liu Lan</b>

00:55.950 --> 00:58.660
<b>Living at Room 607, No. 48, 
Tongli Lane, Nande District</b>

01:00.700 --> 01:04.120
<b>Go! Go! Go! Go!</b>

01:04.960 --> 01:07.900
<b>But strangely, she passed 
away a few years ago.</b>

01:11.660 --> 01:14.610
<b>What? Xu Shanshan sent an MMS</b>

01:16.030 --> 01:17.650
<b>to a person who's already dead?!</b>

01:19.200 --> 01:21.350
<b>Captain Xiao, there's another tricky issue</b>

01:21.350 --> 01:22.980
<b>You may need to come back as soon as possible</b>

01:35.100 --> 01:37.560
<b>What? A witness came to report the case?</b>

01:40.000 --> 01:42.600
<b>Let's start. Tell us everything you know.</b>

01:53.840 --> 01:54.880
<b>This won’t work</b>

01:55.450 --> 01:56.260
<b>You can never catch a doll in this way!</b>

03:55.400 --> 03:56.060
<b>Watch closely</b>

03:56.440 --> 03:57.860
<b>I call this “Swinging Claw”</b>

03:58.840 --> 04:01.030
<b>Will this damage the machine?</b>

04:02.140 --> 04:02.930
<b>Don’t worry</b>

04:03.330 --> 04:04.220
<b>Now!</b>

04:21.830 --> 04:23.600
<b>Ah! You got it!</b>

04:24.690 --> 04:26.160
<b>Xixi, your doll!</b>

04:27.160 --> 04:29.290
<b>See, I told you not to worry!</b>

04:31.020 --> 04:33.780
<b>What’s the trick of this?</b>

04:34.120 --> 04:35.970
<b>Why are you so good at it?</b>

04:37.620 --> 04:39.170
<b>Actually, it’s quite simple</b>

04:39.610 --> 04:42.250
<b>Just move the claw above 
or on the edge of the hole</b>

04:42.440 --> 04:45.460
<b>Then swing it left and right or up and down</b>

04:45.850 --> 04:47.630
<b>Release the claw at the highest point</b>

04:47.900 --> 04:49.880
<b>This will make the claw extend diagonally</b>

04:50.050 --> 04:53.260
<b>Then use inertia to bring 
the doll above the hole</b>

04:53.820 --> 04:57.300
<b>In this moment, the claw will let go 
of it, and it will fall into the hole</b>

04:58.080 --> 04:59.450
<b>The theory is simple</b>

04:59.760 --> 05:02.710
<b>But timing the release of 
the claw takes practice</b>

05:04.580 --> 05:07.800
<b>Um, after you get the doll, 
remember to show an appropriate</b>

05:11.170 --> 05:12.200
<b>happy look...</b>

05:15.760 --> 05:16.780
<b>Xixi, do you like it?</b>

05:26.050 --> 05:28.080
<b>No. 48, Tongli Lane, Nande District</b>

05:29.070 --> 05:30.650
<b>I got the room number this time.</b>

05:31.070 --> 05:32.100
<b>Room 607.</b>

05:34.130 --> 05:35.120
<b>Thank you so much</b>

05:35.300 --> 05:36.970
<b>You even helped us carry these things.</b>

05:37.660 --> 05:39.660
<b>My pleasure. Are these Chinese herbs?</b>

05:40.360 --> 05:42.510
<b>Yes, I brew them myself at home.</b>

05:43.210 --> 05:44.180
<b>What a coincidence.</b>

05:44.780 --> 05:46.390
<b>They met the neighbor next door.</b>

05:48.730 --> 05:51.330
<b>No wonder I can often smell Chinese herbs.</b>

05:52.210 --> 05:53.950
<b>Oops, sorry.</b>

05:54.140 --> 05:55.630
<b>Didn’t notice it would 
spread to the next door.</b>

05:56.680 --> 05:57.520
<b>Never mind. It's OK.</b>

05:59.810 --> 06:01.610
<b>Little girl, you are so cute!</b>

06:01.960 --> 06:03.470
<b>How old are you? What's your name?</b>

06:03.570 --> 06:04.810
<b>Don't touch my sister!</b>

06:07.930 --> 06:11.060
<b>Is he the “good brother” 
mentioned in the message?</b>

06:11.540 --> 06:15.670
<b>Cheng Xiaoshi is also at Room 607, 
No. 48, Tongli Lane, Nande District.</b>

06:16.330 --> 06:17.800
<b>Must be Liu Lan’s home.</b>

06:18.600 --> 06:20.560
<b>Wang, hold on to the tipster.</b>

06:21.130 --> 06:22.180
<b>Don't let her leave.</b>

06:22.420 --> 06:24.360
<b>Then pull up Lan Liu's information 
as soon as possible.</b>

06:24.500 --> 06:25.260
<b>Find it out!</b>

06:40.020 --> 06:40.900
<b>Sorry about that.</b>

06:41.300 --> 06:44.360
<b>He’s just a bit frantic 
trying to protect his sister.</b>

06:45.510 --> 06:46.380
<b>It's OK.</b>

06:46.380 --> 06:47.120
<b>He’s a boy after all.</b>

06:47.300 --> 06:48.560
<b>Boys should protect their sisters.</b>

06:52.650 --> 06:54.210
<b>Thank you so much today.</b>

06:54.210 --> 06:56.700
<b>For carrying the herbs and catching the doll.</b>

06:58.320 --> 06:59.350
<b>No need to thank him.</b>

07:18.640 --> 07:19.970
<b>Sketchy guy.</b>

07:20.810 --> 07:22.450
<b>I hate those who seem to be nice,</b>

07:22.820 --> 07:24.290
<b>but are actually jerks!</b>

07:26.630 --> 07:28.130
<b>At such a young age</b>

07:28.440 --> 07:31.090
<b>why is he so hostile to a neighbor?</b>

07:32.210 --> 07:33.810
<b>Never let people like him touch you.</b>

07:34.350 --> 07:35.200
<b>Got it?</b>

07:35.440 --> 07:37.930
<b>Girls must learn to protect themselves!</b>

07:43.160 --> 07:44.190
<b>Don't laugh,</b>

07:44.310 --> 07:45.620
<b>I'm serious.</b>

07:46.010 --> 07:48.080
<b>This world is all about the 
survival of the fittest.</b>

07:48.170 --> 07:50.480
<b>If you're weak, people 
will bully you even more!</b>

07:52.210 --> 07:54.690
<b>So we must be strong enough.</b>

07:54.690 --> 07:55.720
<b>Learn to say ‘No’.</b>

07:55.810 --> 07:58.960
<b>Only then can we fight back 
and beat those we hate!</b>

07:58.960 --> 08:02.890
<b>Boys at his age are really 
dramatic and passionate.</b>

08:05.520 --> 08:06.190
<b>Ask him</b>

08:06.990 --> 08:08.560
<b>Who told him these.</b>

08:10.140 --> 08:12.400
<b>But, but how?</b>

08:14.830 --> 08:15.670
<b>Follow my lead.</b>

08:16.100 --> 08:16.840
<b>Use sign language.</b>

08:17.740 --> 08:18.690
<b>Raise your index finger.</b>

08:19.660 --> 08:21.470
<b>Swing it upward</b>

08:22.770 --> 08:25.940
<b>Then rotate it in front of 
your mouth several times.</b>

08:32.150 --> 08:34.060
<b>It was a new friend I met recently.</b>

08:34.300 --> 08:35.720
<b>He's so cool!</b>

09:03.500 --> 09:04.680
<b>If you don't have the guts for that</b>

09:05.330 --> 09:06.800
<b>How can you be my friend?</b>

09:11.570 --> 09:14.490
<b>He just waded in the water 
and grabbed the soccer ball!</b>

09:14.800 --> 09:16.660
<b>Though his pants were totally wet.</b>

09:16.810 --> 09:19.460
<b>He looked so cool with 
that reckless attitude!</b>

09:21.910 --> 09:24.340
<b>Why is it cool to be reckless?</b>

09:24.480 --> 09:26.520
<b>I can tell he’s just a naughty boy.</b>

09:27.900 --> 09:29.840
<b>So you do have self-awareness after all.</b>

09:30.960 --> 09:32.220
<b>Lu Guang!</b>

09:33.720 --> 09:36.050
<b>I just saw you using sign language. Terrible.</b>

09:36.280 --> 09:38.160
<b>You forgot everything I 
taught you, didn’t ya?</b>

09:38.400 --> 09:41.120
<b>Alright, how to express 
‘I wanna go home’?</b>

09:44.860 --> 09:46.290
<b>Point to yourself first.</b>

09:46.550 --> 09:47.480
<b>Then nod your head.</b>

09:50.650 --> 09:51.890
<b>Stop, stop.</b>

09:52.430 --> 09:54.050
<b>You should point to your chest.</b>

09:54.050 --> 09:54.890
<b>Understand?</b>

09:57.110 --> 09:59.470
<b>OK, try it again.</b>

10:00.030 --> 10:01.550
<b>Point to yourself and then nod your head.</b>

10:02.570 --> 10:06.400
<b>No. It’s not nodding your 
head, but pointing to it.</b>

10:07.080 --> 10:09.300
<b>Wasn’t it ‘point to the chest’?</b>

10:09.300 --> 10:12.220
<b>I see. Point to your 
chest, and then the head.</b>

10:12.360 --> 10:13.640
<b>I did this ALL correctly.</b>

10:13.780 --> 10:14.680
<b>Take it easy.</b>

10:14.950 --> 10:15.780
<b>Let’s do it again.</b>

10:16.040 --> 10:17.800
<b>Point to your chest first.</b>

10:17.800 --> 10:19.850
<b>Yes, yes, and then the head.</b>

10:20.700 --> 10:23.000
<b>No, point to your head.</b>

10:23.120 --> 10:25.610
<b>Is it right or not...</b>

10:25.800 --> 10:27.650
<b>Yes, point to your head.</b>

10:27.650 --> 10:28.480
<b>No, no.</b>

10:28.480 --> 10:29.420
<b>Wrong place!</b>

10:29.420 --> 10:31.800
<b>Oh my, I’m totally confused...</b>

10:32.860 --> 10:34.410
<b>Look, like this.</b>

10:35.100 --> 10:38.180
<b>This means ‘I’ and ‘want’.</b>

10:40.270 --> 10:42.480
<b>And this one means ‘to return’</b>

10:43.590 --> 10:45.560
<b>Then bring your fingers of 
both hands together like this.</b>

10:45.860 --> 10:49.010
<b>Raise them up like a roof, 
and it means ‘home’.</b>

10:49.660 --> 10:50.990
<b>Put the whole gesture together.</b>

10:50.990 --> 10:52.930
<b>It means ‘I wanna go home’.</b>

10:53.490 --> 10:54.140
<b>Got it?</b>

10:54.700 --> 10:58.100
<b>Lu Guang, are you still there? Lu Guang?</b>

10:58.570 --> 11:00.510
<b>Come on, do it again by yourself.</b>

11:00.510 --> 11:02.650
<b>I didn’t mean ‘nod your head’ before.</b>

11:03.300 --> 11:04.820
<b>Instead, point to yourself with your finger.</b>

11:04.980 --> 11:06.020
<b>At the position of your temple.</b>

11:06.480 --> 11:08.460
<b>Lu Guang, where did you go just now?</b>

11:09.180 --> 11:10.010
<b>I've been here the whole time.</b>

11:10.770 --> 11:11.770
<b>Weird</b>

11:11.990 --> 11:14.280
<b>How could the signal be too poor to connect?</b>

11:15.060 --> 11:17.360
<b>Hey? What are you thinking?</b>

11:28.650 --> 11:29.530
<b>Welcome home</b>

11:29.530 --> 11:32.790
<b>Mm-hmm. We finished that 
batch before year-end.</b>

11:33.320 --> 11:36.340
<b>Tianchen, Xixi, dinner time!</b>

11:49.160 --> 11:51.120
<b>Did Xixi learn any new sign language today?</b>

11:52.580 --> 11:53.790
<b>Haven't seen this doll before.</b>

11:53.990 --> 11:54.890
<b>How did you get it?</b>

11:56.420 --> 11:58.450
<b>I took Xixi to see the doctor again.</b>

11:58.520 --> 12:00.850
<b>On the way back, we stopped 
at a store and got this doll.</b>

12:02.810 --> 12:04.330
<b>Xixi caught it herself?</b>

12:04.710 --> 12:06.610
<b>It should be pretty hard to catch a doll.</b>

12:09.460 --> 12:11.610
<b>I caught it for her in the end.</b>

12:11.610 --> 12:13.070
<b>We were lucky today.</b>

12:13.240 --> 12:14.840
<b>Got it with the last coin.</b>

12:20.900 --> 12:22.960
<b>Alright, let's put the doll away.</b>

12:22.960 --> 12:24.760
<b>The food’s gonna get cold.</b>

12:24.760 --> 12:26.120
<b>Xixi, come and take a seat.</b>

12:26.870 --> 12:27.920
<b>Tianchen,</b>

12:28.470 --> 12:29.900
<b>Come out for dinner.</b>

12:30.920 --> 12:35.500
<b>Wow, it's happy mealtime again.</b>

12:35.620 --> 12:37.680
<b>Pay attention to your current gender and age.</b>

12:37.900 --> 12:39.150
<b>Control your appetite.</b>

12:39.320 --> 12:40.770
<b>Are you kidding me?</b>

12:40.770 --> 12:43.320
<b>A lot of hard work and no 
reward of a full stomach.</b>

12:43.320 --> 12:44.560
<b>I’m gonna quit.</b>

12:45.620 --> 12:47.270
<b>Here, meat will help you grow faster.</b>

12:48.690 --> 12:50.160
<b>What a good brother!</b>

12:50.160 --> 12:51.390
<b>Don't just serve your sister</b>

12:51.730 --> 12:53.020
<b>You should eat more too</b>

12:53.560 --> 12:54.320
<b>I'll pick by myself.</b>

12:54.650 --> 12:56.360
<b>Why are you so impolite to your Dad?</b>

12:56.500 --> 12:58.230
<b>Don't you even know how to be polite?</b>

12:59.340 --> 13:02.010
<b>He’s in his adolescence now, I suppose.</b>

13:02.640 --> 13:04.160
<b>How can it be?</b>

13:04.360 --> 13:05.980
<b>He’s just a kid.</b>

13:06.980 --> 13:09.180
<b>Don't underestimate kids nowadays.</b>

13:09.450 --> 13:12.160
<b>Wait, wait, leave the last two kills for me!</b>

13:14.310 --> 13:15.280
<b>What a noob</b>

13:15.280 --> 13:17.250
<b>Can’t believe they’re challenging 
our guild with such low skills</b>

13:17.580 --> 13:20.140
<b>As the leader, my shooting 
skill is really underestimated.</b>

13:20.490 --> 13:21.400
<b>Alright, alright.</b>

13:21.650 --> 13:24.020
<b>Here they come, kill them all!</b>

13:24.020 --> 13:24.640
<b>Let none survive</b>

13:24.640 --> 13:25.740
<b>Wipe them out!</b>

13:28.620 --> 13:30.680
<b>It feels really good</b>

13:30.680 --> 13:31.820
<b>to have a meal with family members.</b>

13:32.620 --> 13:35.510
<b>So, you may relax a bit before the New Year?</b>

13:36.050 --> 13:37.170
<b>Not sure.</b>

13:37.700 --> 13:39.840
<b>The factory’s gonna promote some employees.</b>

13:40.400 --> 13:42.420
<b>I still have to perform well.</b>

13:42.420 --> 13:44.320
<b>You’ve been rated as the ‘Advanced 
Employee’ these years.</b>

13:44.320 --> 13:45.980
<b>If you can’t be the 
deputy director this year,</b>

13:45.980 --> 13:48.690
<b>The workers should be dissatisfied as well.</b>

13:49.380 --> 13:51.200
<b>Well, the deputy director is just a title.</b>

13:51.460 --> 13:53.010
<b>It's not that meaningful.</b>

13:53.120 --> 13:56.110
<b>Tianchen, behave yourself at school.</b>

13:56.110 --> 14:00.080
<b>Especially when making friends, you must 
befriend those with good grades and good character.</b>

14:00.080 --> 14:00.880
<b>Do you hear me?</b>

14:01.860 --> 14:02.560
<b>Hmm.</b>

14:03.570 --> 14:07.370
<b>By the way, the message on the back of the 
photo, “Can’t lose my good brother”</b>

14:07.370 --> 14:08.620
<b>What does it mean exactly?</b>

14:09.290 --> 14:10.740
<b>Isn’t her brother well?</b>

14:16.250 --> 14:20.020
<b>By the way, did you buy 
a new camera for them?</b>

14:21.000 --> 14:23.340
<b>Huh? No, I didn't.</b>

14:23.650 --> 14:24.380
<b>Why?</b>

14:28.880 --> 14:31.120
<b>Then whose camera is on the cabinet?</b>

14:32.170 --> 14:33.940
<b>I don't remember we have this model.</b>

14:35.760 --> 14:37.020
<b>I don’t understand</b>

14:37.260 --> 14:39.050
<b>Which cabinet are you talking about?</b>

14:39.290 --> 14:41.170
<b>You still wanna fool me!</b>

14:41.460 --> 14:44.040
<b>I saw you deliberately hide it just now!</b>

14:45.500 --> 14:46.920
<b>Xixi, hurry, sit down.</b>

14:58.290 --> 15:01.740
<b>You think I wouldn't have noticed 
if you put a doll in front of it?!</b>

15:01.740 --> 15:03.760
<b>During the dinner, I kept trying</b>

15:03.760 --> 15:05.430
<b>Trying to put this out of my mind</b>

15:05.430 --> 15:07.000
<b>But I can’t now!</b>

15:07.190 --> 15:08.650
<b>What's going on?</b>

15:12.870 --> 15:14.910
<b>Who gave this to you!</b>

15:15.240 --> 15:18.060
<b>I... I bought it for Xixi myself.</b>

15:18.060 --> 15:20.770
<b>Bullshit! You’re still lying!</b>

15:20.890 --> 15:23.620
<b>Everyone in the neighborhood 
knows about you and that man!</b>

15:23.620 --> 15:25.280
<b>Don’t you have any shame!</b>

15:25.930 --> 15:27.440
<b>Hey, busy day, huh</b>

15:28.360 --> 15:29.590
<b>Finally all done.</b>

15:29.770 --> 15:33.390
<b>By the way, I got a pack of cigarettes 
from a guest. Can’t refuse.</b>

15:33.390 --> 15:34.460
<b>You know I don't smoke.</b>

15:34.460 --> 15:36.100
<b>Would you like to take it?</b>

15:36.580 --> 15:39.320
<b>Oh, that’s not proper</b>

15:39.600 --> 15:41.300
<b>It's fine, just take it.</b>

15:41.300 --> 15:42.320
<b>Thanks then.</b>

15:46.720 --> 15:50.180
<b>There's something I'm not 
sure if I should tell you.</b>

15:50.420 --> 15:53.420
<b>That Male teacher came again today.</b>

15:53.690 --> 15:55.850
<b>With a gift perhaps.</b>

15:57.670 --> 16:00.160
<b>Did he give you this damn camera!</b>

16:00.440 --> 16:02.800
<b>Did he! Did he! Did he! Did he!</b>

16:03.300 --> 16:05.700
<b>How many times have you cheat on me with him?</b>

16:06.370 --> 16:07.640
<b>Did I not warn you?</b>

16:07.640 --> 16:09.180
<b>Don't flirt with others.</b>

16:09.180 --> 16:10.500
<b>Why won't you listen?</b>

16:10.660 --> 16:12.260
<b>Or you just wanna be a bitch?</b>

16:12.590 --> 16:14.690
<b>It, it’s not true.</b>

16:15.240 --> 16:16.870
<b>Mr. Zhou cares about Xixi.</b>

16:17.280 --> 16:19.020
<b>He hopes she can go to a 
special education school</b>

16:19.610 --> 16:21.170
<b>That's why he came to visit us.</b>

16:22.500 --> 16:24.940
<b>Then why doesn’t he care about other kids</b>

16:24.940 --> 16:26.740
<b>Why does he focus on our Xixi?</b>

16:26.960 --> 16:28.900
<b>I’d say it’s you that he really focus on!</b>

16:29.200 --> 16:32.300
<b>Go to a special education school...</b>

16:32.300 --> 16:33.900
<b>How can we afford this!</b>

16:33.900 --> 16:35.700
<b>What's the problem to 
let a girl stay at home?</b>

16:35.700 --> 16:38.160
<b>Learn to be a good wife and 
mother. That’s enough!</b>

16:38.380 --> 16:39.720
<b>Don't be like her mother.</b>

16:40.040 --> 16:43.610
<b>Getting a mouth full of 
sweet talks and flirting!</b>

16:44.980 --> 16:46.540
<b>Ah, Liu Lan.</b>

16:46.830 --> 16:50.340
<b>It never occurred to me 
that for your Mr. Zhou,</b>

16:50.340 --> 16:52.000
<b>you would lie to me again and again</b>

16:52.300 --> 16:55.130
<b>Oh, and this, this...</b>

16:56.500 --> 16:58.530
<b>He also gave this to you, didn't he?</b>

16:58.660 --> 17:00.880
<b>Got it from a claw machine? What a lie!</b>

17:02.190 --> 17:02.930
<b>Stop!</b>

17:03.240 --> 17:05.770
<b>You liar, liar, liar</b>

17:11.250 --> 17:13.420
<b>Tianchen, take your sister inside.</b>

17:13.720 --> 17:14.610
<b>Close the door!</b>

17:17.890 --> 17:19.720
<b>Still there? Get inside</b>

17:23.310 --> 17:24.100
<b>Cheng Xiaoshi.</b>

17:27.810 --> 17:28.680
<b>Now</b>

17:34.400 --> 17:35.980
<b>Liar, you deserve it</b>

17:36.600 --> 17:38.740
<b>How dare you cry? How dare you</b>

17:41.090 --> 17:45.400
<b>Why? why do you force me, huh?</b>

17:45.950 --> 17:47.320
<b>It's all your fault!</b>

17:50.760 --> 17:54.220
<b>I work hard every day for this family...</b>

17:55.340 --> 17:59.140
